   "text": "MindMap · Status · Findings (when it has questions or takeaways), as live;\nred: one table across the Tasks and the figure, kept as proposals; every section starts closed (▸), its state word on its right, a waiting line under one that waits on you; what it opens to is drawn under its bar, behind a dashed line;\neach view's 🙋 Interaction holds its own forms; the right rail ends Skills · Files, as live (261106)",
